Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.82,0:00:05.54,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\\fade(255,0,255,0,850,4650,5380)\pos(629.198,432.083)}Episode 44\N \N\N\N\NReturn to Jing Province
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.46,0:00:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold, Imperial Uncle!\NHere is the newly built garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.62,0:00:14.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Follow me, I will show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.26,0:00:15.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,How fabulous!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.50,0:00:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course. Please, take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.62,0:00:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.10,0:00:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Imperial Uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.58,0:00:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Imperial Uncle, please look.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.34,0:00:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Imperial Uncle,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.22,0:00:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,my Lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.16,0:00:46.80,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(649.552,512.727)\\fade(255,0,255,0,400,2300,2700)}Liú Bèi\NStyled: Xuándé
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.68,0:00:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,This is more or less everything in the new garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.88,0:00:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it to your liking?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.20,0:00:53.12,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(266.098,390)\\fade(255,0,255,0,400,3575,3940)}Lady Sūn
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.96,0:00:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Ziheng, I will not stay here for the long term.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.44,0:00:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did the Marquis of Wu construct this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.72,0:01:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord has said that the houses of Sun and Liu uniting is a most important matter for the empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.20,0:01:06.60,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(401.194,508.636)\\fade(255,0,255,0,400,5020,5380)}Lǚ Fàn\NStyled: Zǐhéng
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.80,0:01:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You have had to fight all your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.94,0:01:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you are staying for a little while,\N we want you to enjoy life with your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.52,0:01:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I am most grateful for the Marquis' grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.32,0:01:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I ask that you two move to the garden at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.24,0:01:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Please do not let his sincerity be in vain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.48,0:01:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,-Very well.\N-Come.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.16,0:01:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.92,0:01:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Liu Bei has finally moved into the new garden!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.28,0:01:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.44,0:01:58.44,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(985.245,503.182)\\fade(255,0,255,0,400,3580,3980)}Sūn Quán\NStyled: Zhòngmóu
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.88,0:01:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Send more servants to deliver gifts and treasures.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.72,0:02:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Entertain him as much as possible.\N Let him indulge to no end!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.92,0:02:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a moment, my dear husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.12,0:02:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not follow us any further.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.16,0:02:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.40,0:02:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,My dear, you are this young,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.68,0:02:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,yet you must marry a fifty year old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.28,0:02:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sad because of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.44,0:02:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,My husband, to spend \Nmy life with a hero such as you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.64,0:02:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,is everything I wanted in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.68,0:03:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You have blessed me for three lifetimes!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.96,0:03:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Liu Bei, Liu Bei!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.48,0:03:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Gongjin's stratagem was wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.00,0:03:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Great decision-making, my lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.08,0:03:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You killed Liu Bei's ambitions \Nwithout him even realizing it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.80,0:03:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems Jing Province will be in chaos before long.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.04,0:03:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Third Brother! Third Brother! \NIt's already late into the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.84,0:03:46.16,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(302.942,507.273)\\fade(255,0,255,0,400,4940,5340)}Guān Yǔ\NStyled: Yúncháng
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.40,0:03:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We can just go tomorrow morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.44,0:03:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.60,0:03:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can't get an answer now, I won't be able to sleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.52,0:03:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Third Brother! Third Brother! Do not be so rash!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.36,0:03:52.16,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(973.743,490.909)\\fade(255,0,255,0,400,2420,2820)}Zhūgé Liàng\NStyled: Kǒngmíng
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.04,0:03:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Third Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.96,0:04:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Strategos.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.40,0:04:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Strategos, our Elder Brother\N has been missing for over ten days.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.36,0:04:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Why isn't there any news?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.16,0:04:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you suppose?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.36,0:04:43.52,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(364.35,485.455)\\fade(255,0,255,0,500,5820,6180)}Zhāng Fēi \NStyled: Yìdé
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.04,0:04:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess he got married and is living in comfort now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.44,0:04:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He forgot about us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.44,0:04:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I think our Elder Brother is not one\N to indulge in pleasures like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.32,0:05:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yunchang is correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.80,0:05:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Even in times of hardship, you have stayed together.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.76,0:05:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Now our fortune is turning for the better with Jing as our base.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.52,0:05:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it is time for us to work\N together to finish our great task.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.72,0:05:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Would our lord abandon it thus?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.20,0:05:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Heroes are soft on beautiful women.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.32,0:05:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this some kind of love spell by Sun Quan's sister,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.84,0:05:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,to keep my brother infatuated?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.18,0:05:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Strategos, why not send us to have him back?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.62,0:05:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I have calculated that our lord \Nwill return early next year, not this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.06,0:06:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,If Elder Brother doesn't return to Jing Province,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.70,0:06:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,you will be responsible, Strategos!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.90,0:06:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Very good!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.86,0:06:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,General Zhao, the Imperial Uncle says he is too busy to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.16,0:06:31.10,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(357.527,467.727)\\fade(255,0,255,0,0,4180,4540)}Zhào Yún\NStyled: Zǐlóng
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.66,0:06:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Does he have any orders for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.30,0:06:32.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,He orders you to rest well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.98,0:06:34.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,The soldiers are to cause no trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.06,0:06:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Gongjin, your plan is so excellent!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.58,0:06:46.86,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(279.744,490.909)\\fade(255,0,255,0,400,3900,4260)}Lǔ Sù\NStyled: Zǐjìng
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.06,0:06:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Liu Bei now spends all day with Lady Sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.62,0:06:54.18,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(330.235,488.182)\\fade(255,0,255,0,400,4180,4500)}Zhōu Yú\NStyled: Gōngjǐn
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.66,0:06:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Even when Zhao Yun wanted to visit him, he refused to see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.94,0:06:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,He let him go after passing him a few words.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.66,0:06:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Marvelous!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.54,0:07:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Marvelous! He will not even see Zhao Yun!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.46,0:07:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Zijing, return to Nanxu and tell the Marquis of Wu
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.26,0:07:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,that Liu Bei and Zhao Yun must not see each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.10,0:07:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,In this way, he will forget all about Jing Province.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.90,0:07:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,As you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.46,0:07:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, buy one! It will bless your family and realize your wishes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.62,0:07:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.06,0:07:53.62,Thinking,,0,0,0,,The Strategos gave me three bags before I set out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.62,0:07:55.86,Thinking,,0,0,0,,I was to open the first one when I came to Nanxu,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.86,0:07:57.82,Thinking,,0,0,0,,to open the second one at the year's end,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.82,0:08:00.30,Thinking,,0,0,0,,and to open the third one during a time of crisis.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.48,0:08:02.32,Thinking,NTP,0,0,0,,Now that the year is almost over,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.32,0:08:04.76,Thinking,NTP,0,0,0,,why not open the second one?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.28,0:10:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Imperial Uncle, a report from the lodging house.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.88,0:10:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhao Yun reports some urgent military news.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.12,0:10:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Military news?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.40,0:10:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,They say Jing Province \Nis on the verge of falling.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.08,0:11:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Zilong, what is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.84,0:11:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, for your trip to marry into Eastern Wu,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.36,0:11:12.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,the Strategos gave me an important task.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.76,0:11:15.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,He ordered me to escort you safely back to Jing Province.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.32,0:11:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The year is at an end, yet you\N still do not think about returning.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.52,0:11:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I have let down both you and the Strategos!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.04,0:11:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, do not abandon glory\N for the sake of petty diversions.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.72,0:11:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,A secret envoy from the Strategos came last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.36,0:11:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,He said Cao Cao wishes to avenge his loss at Chibi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.16,0:11:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,He is marching on Jing with 500,000 elite troops!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.12,0:11:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The situation is critical!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.68,0:12:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Strategos begs you to return at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.60,0:12:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to talk this over with my wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.80,0:12:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,If you discuss it with her, \Nhow can she let you leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.08,0:12:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It is better to deceive her and set out tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.28,0:12:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, if you hesitate, it will mean disaster for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.68,0:12:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I have my reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.12,0:12:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.64,0:12:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That is enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.40,0:13:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,My husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.28,0:13:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,How is the military situation in Jing Province?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.12,0:13:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You look upset. What troubles you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.00,0:13:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.92,0:13:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it an urgent situation?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.80,0:13:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I have wandered far from home all my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.24,0:13:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I could not support my parents before they died.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.28,0:13:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot return to my hometown to pay tribute to my ancestors.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.40,0:13:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,When festivals occur, I think of my relatives. For this, I sigh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.24,0:14:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to deceive me, my husband?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.48,0:14:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course not!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.60,0:14:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not lie to me. General Zhao called to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.20,0:14:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Jing Province must be in danger, so he wants you to return.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.88,0:14:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I right or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.92,0:14:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,My dear, you figured it out. Why hide it any longer?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.64,0:14:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If I do not return, Jing will be lost \Nand I will turn into a laughingstock.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.96,0:14:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I must return...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.40,0:14:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,but it is also hard to leave your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.64,0:14:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on the horns of a dilemma.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.00,0:15:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,My husband, I am here to aid and serve you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.00,0:15:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,If you go back, then I shall follow you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.08,0:15:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I know how you feel,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.08,0:15:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,but the State Mother cherishes you. How could she let you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.48,0:15:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,And the Marquis of Wu will not let us go together.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.32,0:15:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If you understand this, can we separate for a while
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.56,0:15:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,and I will return to fetch you later?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.56,0:15:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,My husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.76,0:15:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,My dear husband, do not worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.92,0:15:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow morning when everyone is at the new year celebration,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.97,0:15:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I will leave, claiming I must sacrifice by the river.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.41,0:15:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We can leave without the need for any goodbyes. Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.52,0:16:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,My dear, I will never forget this favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.56,0:16:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, stand up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.56,0:16:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander! An urgent report from scouts at Nanxu!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.24,0:16:20.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Chief Commander, Zhao Zilong met with Liu Bei.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.32,0:16:22.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,According to your orders, I have come to report.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.96,0:16:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Even during festivities, \Nwe must be on guard for treachery.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.32,0:16:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you informed the Marquis of Wu?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.28,0:16:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,He is having a banquet. We did not dare intrude.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.96,0:16:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,General Ding Feng!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.16,0:16:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.88,0:16:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Give the order to the men of Nanxu to watch Liu Bei closely.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.36,0:16:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,If anything happens, tell the Marquis at once. Do not let the tiger return to its den.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.56,0:16:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.44,0:16:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Also order the navy to patrol the river and its banks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.88,0:16:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The boats must act if they see a suspicious ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.84,0:16:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.44,0:17:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes, exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.60,0:17:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.80,0:17:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.04,0:17:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.89,0:17:08.45,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(917.015,327.273)\\fade(255,0,255,0,0,4180,4540)}State Mother Wú
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.21,0:17:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.45,0:17:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We wish you a long life and boundless fortune, mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.09,0:17:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, good, good. Get up. Please rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.33,0:17:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother, why is my brother not here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.09,0:17:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,He had a banquet yesterday. He is still very drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.89,0:17:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,The Imperial Uncle's mother and ancestors are buried in Zhuo Commandery.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.73,0:17:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,He wishes to pay respects at the north river bank. Please, mother, be understanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.49,0:17:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,,This is filial piety. How could I refuse?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.69,0:18:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Although you do not know your in-laws,\N you should accompany Xuande in the ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.89,0:18:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the duty of a good wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.65,0:18:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for sympathizing with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.53,0:18:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother, we are in the first few days of the year.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.01,0:18:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you let me comb your hair?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.09,0:18:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.69,0:18:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,My dear, you have always been so tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.97,0:18:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you become so soft after marrying Xuande?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.93,0:18:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.41,0:18:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Accompany Xuande now. The sooner you leave, the sooner you will return.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.77,0:19:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You have our thanks, honored mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.81,0:19:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,No need to be so polite.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.21,0:19:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, let us be on our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.69,0:20:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.93,0:20:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.45,0:20:28.77,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(977.058,471.818)\\fade(255,0,255,0,400,4020,4340)}Zhāng Zhāo\NStyled: Zǐbù
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.61,0:20:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Why have you not awoken our lord yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.93,0:20:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Our lord is still inebriated!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.97,0:20:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.77,0:20:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.97,0:20:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, wake up, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.61,0:20:44.37,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(903.564,434.805)\\fade(255,0,255,0,400,2350,2760)}Nánxú
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.89,0:21:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.77,0:21:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it? What is this insolence?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.13,0:21:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.25,0:21:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Liu Bei took Lady Sun and left the city \Nwith her. They are heading towards the river.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.77,0:21:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Liu Bei is escaping. Disaster is upon us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.09,0:21:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Send someone to pursue them now!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.41,0:21:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Chen Wu, Pan Zhang!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.45,0:21:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.37,0:21:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Take five hundred riders\N and chase them at full speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.33,0:21:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring back Liu Bei! Report after you are done.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.69,0:21:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.29,0:21:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,That blasted Liu Bei!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.69,0:21:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear I will catch you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.41,0:21:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Your head shall be mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.41,0:22:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord! Even if you have sky-reaching fury,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.21,0:22:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,you should remain calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.05,0:22:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I reckon Chen Wu and Pan Zhang\N will not be able to catch Liu Bei.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.81,0:22:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,They would not dare to challenge my orders!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.93,0:22:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,The Lady has watched martial affairs \Nsince childhood and is resolute in temper.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.21,0:22:31.29,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(930.661,439.091)\\fade(255,0,255,0,400,4740,5100)}Chéng Pǔ\NStyled: Démóu
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.89,0:22:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no officer who does not fear her.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.93,0:22:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,She is accompanying Liu Bei on his journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.59,0:22:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,If Chen Wu and the others catch up to them
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.67,0:22:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,they will not dare move in fear of her wrath.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.15,0:22:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Jiang Qin, Zhou Tai!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.39,0:22:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.07,0:22:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You two pursue as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.67,0:22:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,If they do not comply,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.71,0:22:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,use this sword to take the heads of both my sister and Liu Bei.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.99,0:23:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone who disobeys this will be executed!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.67,0:23:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.31,0:23:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What place is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.71,0:23:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Once we pass three trees \Nand go around the mountain,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.51,0:23:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,we will arrive at Chaisang.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.71,0:23:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,That is where Zhou the Youth is stationed. Security must be tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.79,0:23:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful not to alert the garrison.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.95,0:23:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Worry not, my lord. I prepared something in advance.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.55,0:23:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord! Pursuing troops caught up to our rear!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.79,0:23:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.47,0:23:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,They are ahead! Pursue!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.47,0:24:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.39,0:24:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get them!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.55,0:24:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.87,0:24:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.99,0:24:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Halt, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.79,0:24:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,We have a large army ahead \Nand a pursuing one behind us. What to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.43,0:24:45.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Worry not. Out of the three bags the Strategos gave me,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.15,0:24:47.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I opened two. Their predictions were true.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.67,0:24:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It is time to open the third one.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.43,0:25:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,My dear wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.75,0:25:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Husband, why are we not moving?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.59,0:25:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,My wife...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.63,0:25:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,My dear,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.87,0:25:24.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I have something to confess.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.87,0:25:26.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I must tell you the truth now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.47,0:25:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean? Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.27,0:25:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,The reason the Marquis wanted to marry you to me
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.71,0:25:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,was not for your sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.39,0:25:41.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,In reality, he wanted to take me \Nhostage in exchange for Jing Province.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.11,0:25:42.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,After that, he would kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.91,0:25:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,They merely used you as bait.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.63,0:25:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why did you still come to Wu?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.87,0:25:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I had two reasons to risk my life coming here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.47,0:25:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,One was for the sake of the alliance to resist Cao Cao.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.95,0:26:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,The other was that I admired your character and wished to spend my life with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.35,0:26:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I am blessed you have accompanied me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.19,0:26:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I did not expect the Marquis to send a pursuing party behind us
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.35,0:26:10.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,and for Zhou Yu to send generals ahead to stop us.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.83,0:26:13.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I am cornered. I beg for your aid.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.07,0:26:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,If you do not accept,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.55,0:26:17.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,then I will charge ahead into my death
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.99,0:26:20.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,so as to repay the kindness you gave me in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.79,0:26:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,My husband...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.35,0:26:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,My brother does not consider me his own flesh and blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.22,0:26:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What respect between siblings is there to uphold?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.67,0:26:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,My husband, I will save you from this danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.95,0:26:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,My wife...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.91,0:26:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What shall we do, General Xu?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.39,0:26:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you planning for treason?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.27,0:26:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,My lady, how could we dare to rebel?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.03,0:27:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,We are following orders from \Nthe Chief Commander to wait for Liu Bei.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.67,0:27:03.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Zhou Yu, that bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.35,0:27:06.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Wu has treated him well, yet he commits such a heinous ruse.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.19,0:27:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Xuande is the Imperial Uncle and my husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.47,0:27:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,We have formally married. Everyone knows this.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.67,0:27:17.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I already told my mother and brother I am going to Jing Province.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.27,0:27:20.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Or are you here perhaps to rob us?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.07,0:27:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,We would not dare! Please, calm your anger.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.55,0:27:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,These are orders from Commander Zhou.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.39,0:27:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,So you fear Zhou Yu but not me?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.99,0:27:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think I cannot kill Zhou Yu if he can harm you two?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.64,0:27:33.79,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(962.826,469.091)\\fade(255,0,255,0,0,4180,4540)}Dīng Fèng\NStyled: Chéngyuān
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.71,0:27:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Step aside!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.75,0:27:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,As you wish...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.29,0:27:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Zilong, go ahead. Let us see\N if anyone else dares to stop us.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.33,0:28:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.37,0:28:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Generals Chen Wu and Pan Zhang have arrived!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.93,0:28:25.65,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(316.588,452.727)\\fade(255,0,255,0,0,4180,4540)}Pān Zhāng\NStyled: Wénguī
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.01,0:28:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, did you two just let Liu Bei go?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.82,0:28:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Per the State Mother and \Nthe Marquis' orders, Lady Sun said.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.49,0:28:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We had to let them through.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.05,0:28:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Wrong! We are here on the Marquis' orders to catch Liu Bei.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.45,0:28:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick! Move out!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.17,0:29:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,My dear, the pursuing party has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.09,0:29:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead with the men. \NZilong and I will stop them.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.97,0:29:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I am grateful, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.89,0:29:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.81,0:29:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,We pay our respects, my lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.05,0:29:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Chen Wu, Pan Zhang. What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.85,0:29:48.69,Default,,0,0,0,,We are following our lord's orders. \NPlease, return to Nanxu with Xuande.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.49,0:29:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You are the ones sowing discord between me and my brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.65,0:29:56.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I am leaving with my husband, not fleeing to seclusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.09,0:29:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I am just obeying my mother by returning to Jing for a visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.65,0:30:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if my brother comes here, I will still go.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.37,0:30:06.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You have been pursuing us with weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.45,0:30:08.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Do you wish to kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.93,0:30:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You expressed your regret, but once again you have evil intentions.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.69,0:30:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Go and tell Zhou Yu now that I want his head!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.81,0:30:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,She's still our lord's sister,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.73,0:30:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,and she even has the State Mother's support.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.57,0:30:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The Marquis is a filial man. How will he reject his mother's orders?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.57,0:30:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,If he were to change his mind,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.21,0:30:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,will we not be the ones bearing the blame?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.69,0:30:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget what happened with Jia Hua at Ganlu temple.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.69,0:30:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,We might as well placate her.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.57,0:30:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go see the Commander and inform him.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.93,0:30:58.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Do as you please, my lady. We're going back!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.81,0:31:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you see Liu Bei?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.61,0:31:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,He passed through two watches ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.21,0:31:23.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,This is the Marquis of Wu's sword. We have orders
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.81,0:31:25.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,to kill the lady and then Liu Bei.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.97,0:31:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Disobey and be executed!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.57,0:31:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,They've already left!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.69,0:31:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Liu Bei goes with both infantry and cavalry.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.09,0:31:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I think he has not crossed the river yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.41,0:31:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,We can still send generals Ding and Xu to inform the Commander
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.85,0:31:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,and tell him to send ships to stop them.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.97,0:31:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,We can pursue them following the riverbank.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.09,0:31:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Be it through water or land, we shall pursue them.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.45,0:31:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,We will cut them down without question,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.69,0:31:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,and then inform the Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.57,0:31:55.77,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(977.058,489.545)\\fade(255,0,255,0,0,4180,4540)}Jiǎng Qīn \NStyled: Gōngyì
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.17,0:31:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Good idea. General Ding.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.97,0:31:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Best we go with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.01,0:32:09.01,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(507.2,267.2)}Liuliang Shore
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.61,0:32:17.53,Style Names,,0,0,0,,Liuliang Shore
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.33,0:32:28.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Imperial Uncle, why are you weeping?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.93,0:32:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I was remembering the happy times we had in Jiangdong.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.09,0:32:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Our feelings were tender like water. They shall not return.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.33,0:32:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The ambitions of a real man must flow into the great ocean like the Yangzi River.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.33,0:32:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Why look fondly on the comfort of one's home?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.05,0:32:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord! My lord! The pursuers are approaching.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.81,0:33:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.61,0:33:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,My lady, do not leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.85,0:33:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,My lady, do not leave! The Marquis' sword is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.37,0:33:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,My husband, I don't know what to do anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.37,0:33:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not try to escape, Liu Bei!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.09,0:33:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,We have marched for days. The men are exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.53,0:33:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,We are between the Long River and the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.17,0:33:43.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Liuliang Shore...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.53,0:33:46.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Am I really to die in this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.65,0:33:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord! There are ships over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.25,0:33:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord! Thank Heaven the ships are here! Hurry, get on.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.68,0:34:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us cross to the other side and talk later.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.29,0:34:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.81,0:34:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.69,0:34:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I, Zhuge Liang, have been waiting \Nfor you for a long time, my lord, my lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.85,0:34:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us set sail.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.61,0:34:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Where do you think you're going, Liu Bei!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.25,0:34:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Go back and tell Zhou the Youth
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.65,0:34:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,not to ever use a beauty trap again!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.21,0:34:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.81,0:34:59.49,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Shoot them!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.85,0:35:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Liu Bei, Kongming, do not escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.45,0:35:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, my lady, I will go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.33,0:36:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.37,0:36:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Pursue them!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.13,0:36:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.17,0:37:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,We have fallen for the enemy's trap! Retreat!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.29,0:37:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.65,0:38:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Set sail!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.32,0:38:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.909}{\pos(640,670)}Zhou the Youth planned to take the land.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.47,0:38:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord10.909}Instead he lost men and the lady's hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.87,0:38:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord10.909}Zhou the Youth planned to take the land.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.75,0:38:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord10.909}Instead he lost men and the lady's hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.39,0:38:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord10.909}Zhou the Youth planned to take the land.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.19,0:38:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord10.909}Instead he lost men and the lady's hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.31,0:38:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhou the Youth planned to take the land.\N Instead he lost men and the lady's hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.75,0:38:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Instead he lost men and the lady's hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.95,0:38:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn the ships around.\N I will have them dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.07,0:39:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander, this is Liu Bei's territory. It is not to our advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.63,0:39:12.43,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Zhou the Youth planned to take the land. Instead he lost men and the lady's hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.43,0:39:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,My plan has failed... How can I look at the Marquis in the face again?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.67,0:40:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander! Chief Commander! Chief Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.55,0:40:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander! Chief Commander! Chief Commander!

